## Acceptance checks

- The notification event and channel are explicit.
- Failure leaves the previous confirmed subscription state intact.
- Stopping a subscription is as discoverable as starting it.
- The icon does not replace the action label.

Check the examples at narrow widths, with a keyboard and without JavaScript. Test a production implementation against its actual data and permissions before calling it supported.

